    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy and permissions</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Accessibility service: swipes inside YouTube and reads the screen\'s structure, only during a session you started.\n\nNotifications: show the running session and its Stop button.\n\nVibration: an optional reminder buzz.\n\nSettings stay on this device. No accounts, no analytics, no ads. The open-source build has no internet permission.</string>
